(card "exp:D-R2-2_blacklist_cross_source" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:D-R2-2_blacklist_cross_source"
  :body "---\nnav: 21\ntype: experiment\nid: D-R2-2_blacklist_cross_source\nshort_name: blacklist_cross_source\ntitle: \"D-R2-2 — default admit ∖ {lc_48h == 2}\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: d\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_d__blacklist_default_admit]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.8486\ntrain_trade_count: 204\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8088\ntrain_sharpe: 6.7455\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0785\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0776\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [blacklist, cross_source]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/d, round/r2, axis/blacklist, axis/cross_source, status/challenger, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# D-R2-2 — default admit ∖ {lc_48h == 2}\n\n> **TL;DR** —— D-R2 系列 single-blacklist 之一：default-admit + 砍 cross-source crowd (lc_48h == 2，即过去 48h 内同源 ≥2 个 leader)。从 214 → 204 笔，train NAV 2.85 与 D-R2-1 几乎 tie。**未跑 test**，作 D-R2-3 / D-R2-4 stack 的单独 component 验证。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：过去 48h 内同源 cross-source crowd (lc_48h == 2) 的 leg = \"已被多人 picked 的 trade\" → mean reversion 已被前人吃掉，自己进去概率亏。\n- 期待：trade_count 略降 (drop 10 笔)，NAV 升或持平。\n- 实测：NAV 2.849 vs 2.857，几乎 tie —— 单条 blacklist effect 微弱。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/scripts/round_2_runner.py`\n- 步骤：default-admit (D-R2-1 base) → drop leg if `lc_48h == 2`.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- `lc_48h` 用 events 表过去 48h half-open window 数同 ticker leader 个数 —— strict past-only (`event_time < t`)。\n- critic audit pass。`#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.8486 | 204 | 6.75 | 80.9% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0785 ± 0.078 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ vs D-R2-1** | -0.008 | -10 | +0.14 | -0.9pp | +0.21pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0.\n- 单 blacklist 几乎 NO-OP —— 真正问题在 D-R2-3 stack 后才显化（test 崩盘）。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-1__default_admit_baseline]]\n- **synthesizes_into**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-3__blacklist_stack_triple]] (D-R2-3 把 lc_48h==2 作 stack 第一条)\n- **borrowed_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_d__D-R1-3__drop_full_consensus]] (R1 同 axis 不同 base)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_d/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (D-R2-2)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- lc_48h == 2 的单 blacklist 是 NO-OP，但被 D-R2-3 拿去作 stack 第一条。**单 component 效果微 → stack 后 effect 不应大幅 amplify**，这是个 sanity warning：D-R2-3 train 涨那么多是 stack 互动 noise，不是 mechanism merit。\n- cross-source consensus 信号在该 trade pool 上 statistical power 偏弱，需更长窗口 (96h / 7d) 或更高 crowd threshold (>=3) 才有效。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_d__D-R2-2__blacklist_cross_source.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:26:02+08:00"
